            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirungu lilishemelerwa, n'ebimuli byamwo bishamure. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lilishemelerwa ligire ebyera bingi muno. Lilishemera nk'amabanga ga Lebanoni, kandi liligira eitonjo nk'amabanga ga Karimeli na Sharoni. Buli omoi alibona okwo Omukama agira ekitinwa n'obushobora, mara aba muhango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Singa ogumise emikono ejegaire, ogumise n'amajwi agalikusimangana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mugambire abashuburugukirwe muti, “Mugume, mutatina! Ruhanga wanyu alija abarokore; ababisha banyu ababonabonyie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Empume zilibona, abaigazi b'amatwi tulihulira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalema tulichoka, baguruke engoma, n'abatagamba tulizina akanyahwera. Emigera eliraba omw'irungu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "omushenye gwokya gulihinduka nyanja, kandi ensi etagira maizi elitabukwamu enchuro zingi. Mtuli emiha yaturaga halimerwa ebibimbili n'orufunjo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eirungu elyo lilirabwamu nyarulembo, nyarulembo egyo tuligyeta Muhanda gutakatifu. Taliho mufakare aliraba muhanda ogwo; kandi taliho bafera tulihabisa atulikugurabamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyarulembo egyo teligira ntare; n'ebikaaka tibilitwarwa muhanda ogwo. Abo Omukama alichungura tuliletwa muhanda ogwo bashube omuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baligaruka Yerusalemu nibashemelerwa, nibeshanda nibazina akanyahwera. Ebiro byona tulishemelerwa, amakiro gona titulimanya bujune na bushasi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
